# 🎵 SoundCloud DJ Set Analyzer

**Automatically identify every track in any SoundCloud DJ set with timestamps and streaming links!**

[![Python 3.8+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.8+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
[![Made with ❤️](https://img.shields.io/badge/Made%20with-❤️-red.svg)](#)

Perfect for DJs, music lovers, and anyone who wants to know "what's that track?" in their favorite DJ sets.

## ✨ Features

- 🎯 **Automatic Track Recognition** - No manual work required
- ⏱️ **Precise Timestamps** - Know exactly when each track starts
- 🎧 **Streaming Links** - Direct links to Spotify & Apple Music
- 📱 **Multiple Formats** - Get results as .txt, .json, and .m3u playlist
- 🔄 **Smart Deduplication** - Removes duplicate detections
- 📊 **Works with Long Sets** - Tested with 3+ hour mixes
- 💰 **Free Tier Friendly** - Uses efficient sampling method

## 🎬 Demo

**Input:** Any SoundCloud DJ set URL  
**Output:** Complete tracklist with streaming links

```
==================================================================
